+        ('JETUSE_SP2_02', 'JETUSE_OCI_CRED')]
+RP EXECUTE を持つ JETUSE 系スキーマ: ['JETUSE_APP']
+buckets: ['jetuse-dev-app-spa', 'jetuse-dev-app-speech', 'jetuse-spike-sp202-rag',
